{"type":"message","id":"94b5f958","parentId":"0e9d40c9","timestamp":"2026-03-12T16:05:18.716Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-03-13 00:05 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 你是 Arch 胡小架。PM 胡小产已经收到【待办任务记录】项目指令。\n\n**你的任务**:\n1. 等待 PM 胡小产的技术评审请求\n2. 协助进行技术选型（Python+Tkinter 或 Electron）\n3. 评估技术风险和可行性\n4. 准备项目结构和部署方案\n\n**技术建议**:\n- 推荐 Python + Tkinter/PyQt 方案（更简单，bat 启动方便）\n- 数据存储用 SQLite 或 JSON\n- 日历组件用 tkcalendar 或自定义\n\n准备就绪后回复\"Arch 待命，等待 PM 技术评审请求\"。"}],"timestamp":1773331518711}}
{"type":"message","id":"3abb7d83","parentId":"94b5f958","timestamp":"2026-03-12T16:05:32.370Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a subagent task where I need to act as \"Arch 胡小架\" (Architecture Engineer Hu Xiaojia). The task is clear:\n\n1. Wait for PM 胡小产's technical review request\n2. Help with technology selection (Python+Tkinter or Electron)\n3. Evaluate technical risks and feasibility\n4. Prepare project structure and deployment plan\n\nThe technical recommendations are already provided:\n- Recommend Python + Tkinter/PyQt (simpler, convenient bat startup)\n- Data storage using SQLite or JSON\n- Calendar component using tkcalendar or custom\n\nI need to acknowledge this task and indicate I'm ready. The instruction says to reply \"Arch 待命，等待 PM 技术评审请求\" when ready.\n\nLet me prepare a comprehensive response that shows I understand my role and am ready to assist.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"# Arch 胡小架 - 技术评审准备就绪\n\n## 📋 任务确认\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 角色 | Arch 胡小架 (技术架构师) |\n| 任务来源 | PM 胡小产 - 【待办任务记录】项目 |\n| 当前状态 | ✅ 待命 |\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ 技术选型预案\n\n### 推荐方案：Python + Tkinter/PyQt\n\n| 维度 | 评估 |\n|------|------|\n| **开发复杂度** | ⭐⭐ 低 (Tkinter 内置，PyQt 组件丰富) |\n| **启动方式** | ⭐⭐⭐ 便捷 (bat 脚本一键启动) |\n| **打包部署** | ⭐⭐ 成熟 (PyInstaller/nuitka) |\n| **学习曲线** | ⭐⭐ 平缓 |\n| **跨平台** | ⭐⭐⭐ 支持 Win/Mac/Linux |\n\n### 备选方案：Electron\n\n| 维度 | 评估 |\n|------|------|\n| **开发复杂度** | ⭐⭐⭐ 中 (需前端技术栈) |\n| **启动方式** | ⭐⭐ 需 Node 环境 |\n| **打包部署** | ⭐⭐ 体积较大 (electron-builder) |\n| **学习曲线** | ⭐⭐⭐ 需 HTML/CSS/JS |\n| **跨平台** | ⭐⭐⭐ 原生支持 |\n\n---\n\n## 📁 项目结构预案\n\n```\ntodo-app/\n├── src/\n│   ├── main.py          # 入口文件\n│   ├── gui/             # 界面模块\n│   │   ├── main_window.py\n│   │   └── calendar_widget.py\n│   ├── models/          # 数据模型\n│   │   └── task_model.py\n│   └── storage/         # 数据存储\n│       └── db.py        # SQLite/JSON 封装\n├── assets/              # 资源文件\n├── requirements.txt     # Python 依赖\n├── build.bat           # Windows 打包脚本\n└── README.md\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 技术风险评估\n\n| 风险项 | 等级 | 应对方案 |\n|--------|------|----------|\n| Tkinter 界面简陋 | 低 | 使用 ttk 主题或切换 PyQt |\n| SQLite 并发写入 | 低 | 单用户场景无影响，加锁处理 |\n| 打包体积过大 | 中 | 使用 nuitka 替代 PyInstaller |\n| 日历组件兼容性 | 低 | 准备自定义实现方案 |\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 准备完成\n\n**Arch 待命，等待 PM 技术评审请求**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"dashscope-coding","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":19964,"output":967,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20931,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773331518715}}
